{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126163042633-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126164506\"/><p>單車男送屯門醫院留醫。</p><p>天水圍發生嚴重車禍。今午(26日)3時13分，一輛中型貨車駛至屏廈路近屏夏路花園時，意外撞倒一名單車男，他當場人仰車翻倒地重傷，並且陷入昏迷。救護車將傷者送往天水圍醫院救治後，再轉送屯門醫院留醫。肇事貨車司機涉嫌「危險駕駛」被捕，現正接受調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.781426+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:30:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:16.335140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:16.755331+00:00","content_hash":"ec2f346b2556cad8c8a8f989532b11c8aa7a26bdff39e106459713ba90076684","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.781426+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}